---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { u } from '../lib/paths';
---

<Base title="Parents and families" description="Billing, privacy, and family visits for parents of University of Mars students.">
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Families"
    title="Parents &amp; families"
    lede="Students control their education records. Families can still reach the offices that send the bill and run the halls."
    crumbs={[{ href: '/parents/', label: 'Parents & families' }]}
  >
    <p class="page-actions">
      <a class="btn" href={`mailto:${site.parentsEmail}`}>Contact the parent desk</a>
    </p>
  </PageHero>
  <article class="prose wrap narrow">
    <h2>Records</h2>
    <p>
      Under FERPA, the university does not discuss grades, conduct, or most aid details with a parent unless the student
      has filed a consent in MyUM or the student is a dependent for tax purposes and the question is one the law allows.
      Directory information is described on the <a href={u('/privacy/')}>privacy page</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>The bill</h2>
    <p>
      A parent may be added as an authorized payer without receiving academic access. That setup is on the student’s
      billing page. Questions about a charge start with the <a href={u('/support/articles/billing/')}>billing article</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Visits</h2>
    <p>
      Family Weekend was October 16–18, 2026. The next family visit day is Saturday, April 10, 2027, during Spring
      Semester 2027. Registration for that day opens in February.
    </p>
    <p>
      Parent desk: <a href={`mailto:${site.parentsEmail}`}>{site.parentsEmail}</a>,
      <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
